[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13983.11, "timestamp": "03:53:03", "text": "ええ、行きますよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13988.26, "timestamp": "03:53:08", "text": "。 ちょっと待ってください。 それを検索しています。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13993.03, "timestamp": "03:53:13", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13997.349, "timestamp": "03:53:17", "text": "私はそれがどの学校なのかを知りました。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13999.75, "timestamp": "03:53:19", "text": "ちょっとワクワクしています。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14003.51, "timestamp": "03:53:23", "text": "えっと、学校は日本の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14005.59, "timestamp": "03:53:25", "text": "学校みたいな感じ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14009.429, "timestamp": "03:53:29", "text": "だけど、うん、たぶんそうだと思う。 わからない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14019.99, "timestamp": "03:53:39", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14022.95, "timestamp": "03:53:42", "text": "それは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14029.79, "timestamp": "03:53:49", "text": "関東地方の県のようなものです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14038.469, "timestamp": "03:53:58", "text": "[音楽]"}]